## PR Title
axi_pkg: keep hardcoded value in typedef for vivado ip packager

## PR Description
Since commit fe4e020, the typedef `axi_pkg::burst_t` relied on a Verilog parameter `BurstWidth`. This caused compatibility issues when using these typedefs in custom Vivado IP ports, as "the IP ports are contained within the port description of the HDL file." The proposed solution defines the typedef with a numerical value, then bases the parameter on the `$size` of this typedef.

